; ------------------------------------------------------------
; Vole Machine Program: Sum of 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5
; Result: 15 (0F hex) is written to the screen (address FF)
; ------------------------------------------------------------
2000 ; [00] R0 = 00 (zero, used by the jump comparisons)
2100 ; [02] R1 = 00 (running sum)
2201 ; [04] R2 = 01 (counter i)
2301 ; [06] R3 = 01 (step)
2406 ; [08] R4 = 06 (stop value)
5112 ; [0A] loop: R1 = R1 + R2
5223 ; [0C] R2 = R2 + R3 (i++)
9524 ; [0E] R5 = R2 XOR R4 (zero when i == 6)
B514 ; [10] if R5 == R0, jump to 14 (done)
B00A ; [12] R0 == R0 always: jump back to 0A
31FF ; [14] print R1
C000 ; [16] halt
